                  "kind": "PreventThatDamage"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "Unsupported",
                  "reason": "No Amount reads how much damage a replacement prevented. TriggeringDamage is refused outside a damage trigger (L028), PreventThatDamage takes no key to store what it prevented, and nothing else counts the damage of the replaced event, so the number of counters cannot be said.",
                  "text": "Put a \u002B1/\u002B1 counter on that creature for each 1 damage prevented this way."
                }
              ]
            },
            "optional": false,
            "where": "Battlefield",
            "selfOnly": false,
            "text": "If damage would be dealt to another creature you control, prevent that damage. Put a \u002B1/\u002B1 counter on that creature for each 1 damage prevented this way."
          },
